  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\n**Given equation:** 14 - 21 × 7 + 3 ÷ 6 = 29\n\nSo, after interchanging the two signs : \n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : × and - \n\n14 - 21 × 7 + 3 ÷ 6 = 29 ⇒ 14 × 21 - 7 + 3 ÷ 6 = 29\n\n⇒ 14 × 21 - 7 + **3 ÷ 6**__ = 29\n\n⇒ __**14 ×**____** 21**__ - 7 + 0.5 = 29\n\n⇒ **__294 + 0.5__** - 7 = 29\n\n⇒ __293.5 - 7__ = 29\n\n⇒ 286.5 ≠ 67 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and ÷ \n\n14 - 21 × 7 + 3 ÷ 6 = 29 ⇒ 14 - 21 ÷ 7 + 3 × 6 = 29\n\n⇒ 14 - **21 **____**÷**____** 7**__ + 3 × 6 = 29\n\n⇒ 14 - 3 + __**3 **____**×**____** 6**__ = 29\n\n⇒ __**14 + 18**__ - 3 = 29\n\n⇒ **__32 - 3__** = 29\n\n**⇒ 29 = 29 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : = and × \n\n14 - 21 × 7 + 3 ÷ 6 = 29 ⇒ 14 - 21 = 7 + 3 ÷ 6 × 29\n\n⇒ **14 - 21**__ = 7 + __**3 ÷ 6**__ × 29\n\n⇒ -7 = 7 + __0.5** **____**× 29**__\n\n⇒ -7 = __**7 + **__**__14.5__**\n\n⇒ -7 ≠ 21.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and - \n\n14 - 21 × 7 + 3 ÷ 6 = 29 ⇒ 14 + 21 × 7 - 3 ÷ 6 = 29\n\n⇒ 14 + 21 × 7 - **3 ÷ 6**__ = 29\n\n⇒ 14 + __**21 × 7**__ - 0.5 = 29\n\n⇒ __**14 +**____** **147__ - 0.5 = 29\n\n⇒ __158 - 0.5__ = 29\n\n⇒ 157.5 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option - (2)\".",
